        <p class="mb-3">
          Express made it straightforward to handle dynamic blog routes:
     <pre class="code-block rounded-3 p-3 mb-0"><code>app.get("/", async (req, res) => {
  const posts = await Post.findAll({
    where: { status: "published" },
    include: Category,
    order: [["createdAt", "DESC"]],
  });

  res.render("index", {
    title: "Hey Kniaz",
    layout: false,
    recentPost: posts[0],
    posts: posts.slice(1),
    user: req.session.userName || null,
    activeCategory: null,
  });
});</code></pre>
        </p>
        <pre class="code-block rounded-3 p-3 mb-0"><code>app.get('/post/:id', async (req, res) => {
  const post = await Post.findByPk(req.params.id);
  res.render('post', { post });
});</code></pre>
